{"name":"Flirtatious","hex":"#ffd637","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"flirtatious","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Of or pertaining to flirtation.","Having a tendency to flirt often."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/flirtatious"}],"entries":[{"title":"Flirting","blocks":[{"text":"Flirting, formally known as coquetry, is a form of social communication via body language, verbal expressions, or written language, intended to evoke feelings of playful excitement and potential romantic or sexual interest. Flirting can change in intention as well as intensity, whether it is performed for short-term fun or employed with a longer-term intention of seeking a romantic or sexual relationship."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f7/Das_werdenSie_ja_nachher_schon_sehen.jpg/330px-Das_werdenSie_ja_nachher_schon_sehen.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Flirting"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/25/Jealousy_and_Flirtation.jpg/500px-Jealousy_and_Flirtation.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/25/Jealousy_and_Flirtation.jpg/500px-Jealousy_and_Flirtation.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"A study in body language: Haynes King's Jealousy and Flirtation","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AJealousy_and_Flirtation.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/93/Marilyn_Monroe_and_Cary_Grant_in_Monkey_Business_trailer_3.JPG/250px-Marilyn_Monroe_and_Cary_Grant_in_Monkey_Business_trailer_3.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/93/Marilyn_Monroe_and_Cary_Grant_in_Monkey_Business_trailer_3.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org